# Jumps to the second galaxy: launches from Lave with a galactic hyperdrive, arms it with G and starts the
# countdown with H, and arrives at the system GalacticJump picks in galaxy 2, whose chart F5 then shows. It
# starts from galactic-hyperdrive.cdr (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py): the reference's own save with a galactic
# hyperdrive fitted. G is held from the launch tunnel, so the first frame in space arms the drive.
file JAMESON.CDR galactic-hyperdrive.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # the disc menu
key l; wait 0.3                    # Load Commander: it asks for a file name
key j; key a; key m; key e; key s; key o; key n; key Return; wait 0.5
